  "note": "Election of 12 members of Warrenpoint Urban District Council on 18 May 1949. The West Ward was contested; the five East Ward members were returned unopposed. Shaw, Savage and M'Allister retired and were replaced by Gordon, Hammond and M'Nelis; Greene and West were the old councillors. Returned unopposed."
